OL,3,GNEWSAMPs urge Burnham to take action on
OL,4,AA64 dualling
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour North Yorkshire MPs have called on
OL,7,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham to make
OL,8,Fdualling more of the A64 a priority for
OL,9,Fhis government.
OL,11,FIn a joint letter, the MPs said the
OL,12,Froad was a "vital economic artery"
OL,13,Flinking York with Malton, Scarborough
OL,14,Fand the Yorkshire coast, as well as
OL,15,Fproviding important connections to
OL,16,Fother towns across the county.
OL,18,FSignificant stretches remain single
OL,19,Fcarriageway, which they said caused
OL,20,Fcongestion, unreliable journey times
OL,21,Fand acted as a barrier to investment,
OL,22,Ftourism and economic growth.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
